// BUGS FIXED IN THIS FILE:
//
// 1. VIDEO INVISIBLE — Root cause:
//    .home-video { z-index: -20 }  →  sits behind the browser body background
//    The two overlay divs used Tailwind "-z-10" = z-index:-10, also behind body.
